  "readmeFile": "Package.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0: Initial release. Opens the outer ZIP a .fig/.jam file actually is on\ndisk (canvas.fig, thumbnail.png, meta.json, images/*), then decodes canvas.fig's magic/version/chunk\nframing and decompresses its Kiwi binary schema (raw-deflate) and message data (Zstandard) chunks,\nusing Universal.Common.IO.Compression's from-scratch codecs (no third-party dependency).\nVerified end-to-end against real Figma-exported .fig files.",
